    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Seadogs of Nassau</strong>\u00a0is essentially a pirate simulator where you'll fund your high seas piracy by growing and managing a criminal empire back at Nassau. Your main goal is to build your legacy before age slows you down. Each year you\u2019ll decide which ships and creatures to hunt based on what they carry, who protects them, and how much chaos their loss will cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every voyage brings diseases and cursed beasts. some bless you, others will kill you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coordinate Brutal Naval Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in exhilarating naval battles with a pirate vessel of your own making. Fight dirty or honorably with skills befit of a seafaring corsair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge sandbox-world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your fleet in real-time battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of random events from people being publicly hanged, diseases spreading, sailors smuggling contraband and so much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/61b52be0f081c4e91409a68fee5d1a4e.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Seadogs of Nassau</strong>\u00a0is essentially a pirate simulator where you'll fund your high seas piracy by growing and managing a criminal empire back at Nassau. Your main goal is to build your legacy before age slows you down. Each year you\u2019ll decide which ships and creatures to hunt based on what they carry, who protects them, and how much chaos their loss will cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every voyage brings diseases and cursed beasts. some bless you, others will kill you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coordinate Brutal Naval Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in exhilarating naval battles with a pirate vessel of your own making. Fight dirty or honorably with skills befit of a seafaring corsair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.poster.avif?t=1754248024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.webm?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.mp4?t=1754248024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge sandbox-world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your fleet in real-time battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of random events from people being publicly hanged, diseases spreading, sailors smuggling contraband and so much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An empire-building sandbox where you start as a lowborn deckhand and claw your way to ruling a fractured pirate empire.",
